  ID: 8
  type: Map
  nameMod: Escape From The Jungle
  des: "This map features a series of exciting challenges and mini-games that you\u2019ll
    need to complete to progress. The first section includes a parkour course and
    a maze, each designed to test your agility and navigation skills. Your objective
    is to complete both tasks and collect one lever from each, which are required
    to unlock the next part of the map. In the second section, you\u2019ll encounter
    a variety of mini-games and puzzles, such as searching for hidden objects and
    solving logic-based challenges. These activities are crafted to keep you thinking
    and engaged as you move forward through the map. With a mix of physical and mental
    gameplay, this map offers a fun and balanced Minecraft experience whether you're
    playing solo or with friends."
